WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.968
For grown-ups: how to move a profile between devices, and keep a backup.

2
00:00:08.028 --> 00:00:15.953
Open Me, then press and hold Grown-ups. Holding keeps little fingers out.

3
00:00:16.013 --> 00:00:22.546
This is the grown-ups area. The week at a glance sits on top.

4
00:00:22.606 --> 00:00:29.886
Profiles, sync and export all live in Settings. Tap Sync across devices.

5
00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:37.343
Profiles: one for each child. Each keeps its own progress, and switching is one tap.

6
00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:44.792
Sync across devices: turn it on for a player, and you get a short code.

7
00:00:44.852 --> 00:00:55.683
On the other phone or tablet, open the main menu and choose Link a player. Type the code, and the same progress follows.

8
00:00:55.743 --> 00:01:01.419
Keep the code private. Anyone with it can load that player.

9
00:01:01.479 --> 00:01:12.317
Save Data: progress saves to this device on its own. Export makes a backup you can keep, or import on a new device.

10
00:01:12.377 --> 00:01:18.967
That is it. You can watch this again any time in Library, Watch.
